// NARDOK'S BONE WEAPONS - Old School's counter, row for row.
// Wiki: https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Nardok%27s_Bone_Weapons
//
// Stock numbers and the restock rate are his own: ten clubs, ten spears, five daggers, five
// crossbows and a thousand bolts, every row restocking in 12 seconds, which is 20 ticks.
//
// CORRECTED 2026-11-25. This used to stock TWO of the five, with a note saying the club and the
// bolts were deliberately left out because "the club is a drop and the bolts come from elsewhere,
// exactly as in Old School". That is not what Old School does: Nardok's is the one shop that sells
// all five, and the crossbow and the bolts are the reason anybody walks down to him - a bone
// dagger is a curiosity, and the Dorgeshuun crossbow outranges everything short of rune. Leaving
// them out made the trip not worth taking and made the clue that points at him point at nothing
// much.
//
// THE DROPS STAY. drop_tables/scripts/cave_goblin_guard.rs2 still gives all five off the guards,
// which is this build's own addition and not Old School's - a shop existing is no reason to take
// a drop table away from the players who have been using it.
//
// Every price is the obj's own cost=, because the sell multiplier is 1000 per mille, and all five
// already match Old School's: 600, 600, 2000, 2000, 3. Nothing is priced twice.
//
// allstock=no, so an empty counter cannot be used to turn any old item into coins.

[nardok_shop]
scope=shared
size=10
restock=yes
allstock=no
stock1=cave_goblin_bone_club,10,20
stock2=cave_goblin_bone_spear,10,20
stock3=bone_dagger,5,20
stock4=dorgeshuun_crossbow,5,20
stock5=bone_bolts,1000,20
